"""
OBD / UDS Excel Test Specification to CAPL Generator with GUI
==============================================================

Role / intent:
This tool is written for an automotive tooling / validation workflow. It reads one
Excel row as one test case, displays every requested test attribute in a collapsible
TreeView, shows traceability Test ID -> covered requirement(s), and generates one
CAPL testcase per Excel row. Double-clicking a test case generates only that
testcase into a file named with the Test Case ID and opens it in an internal
CAPL syntax-highlighted viewer. The main GUI also has a CAPL Viewer button to
open any existing .can file in the same editable, syntax-highlighted viewer.

Input Excel mapping requested by user:
- B  TC ID
- D  Requirement ID / covered requirements
- E  TC title
- F  Author
- G  Date
- H  Objective / Scope
- I  Precondition / Pre Action, multiline subtree
- J  Action, multiline subtree
- K  Expected Results / Expectation, multiline subtree
- L  Actual Results, multiline subtree
- M  Postcondition / Post Action, multiline subtree
- N  Test Level
- O  System
- P  Priority
- Q  ECU
- R  Test Specification Status
- S  Reviewer
- T  Platform
- U  Variant / Model
- W  Architecture
- X  Test environment constraints
- Y  Test Platform
- Z  Test Goal

Dependency:
    pip install openpyxl

Run:
    python pruefturbo_v70_icon_fixed.py

Build EXE with icon:
    pyinstaller --onefile --windowed --icon PruefTurbo_Icon.ico pruefturbo_v70_icon_fixed.py

Important CAPL integration note:
The generated CAPL is a compile-oriented template and includes project TODO stubs
for ISO-TP / Diagnostic transport, CAN IDs, ignition/RBS, and exact timing limits.
Replace these stubs with the real CANoe/CANalyzer diagnostic setup used in your project.
"""

